- [Awich] <i>Is this what I think it is?</i>

1083
00:46:51,934 --> 00:46:54,186
- You cold?
- No, I want you to wait here.

1084
00:46:54,269 --> 00:46:55,854
- [Nagano] <i>Scary.</i>
- [Megumi] <i>Yeah.</i>

1085
00:47:00,025 --> 00:47:01,610
- [Maririn] It's messed up.
- What?

1086
00:47:01,693 --> 00:47:04,154
[Maririn]
He's dodging the whole conversation.

1087
00:47:04,238 --> 00:47:05,405
- Let's roll.
- Oh, snap!

1088
00:47:05,489 --> 00:47:07,699
- Ah! Here they come.
- No, no, no, no.

1089
00:47:07,783 --> 00:47:11,286
- Come on, girl, just take the hint.
- They're gonna jump him!

1090
00:47:11,370 --> 00:47:14,206
[Maririn] He did say he's on
a "one-way street toward Hikaru,"

1091
00:47:14,289 --> 00:47:17,334
so I asked him if that meant
he's pretending he never got my letter.

1092
00:47:17,417 --> 00:47:19,044
And he said, "Mmm, it's not like that,

1093
00:47:19,127 --> 00:47:21,463
but I guess I was waiting for you
to make a move."

1094
00:47:21,547 --> 00:47:22,756
- What?
- [Maririn] He's like,

1095
00:47:22,839 --> 00:47:25,467
"I was waiting for you
to come talk to me."

1096
00:47:25,551 --> 00:47:28,387
- But you'd already written him a letter.
- [Maririn] I was like, "What?"

1097
00:47:28,470 --> 00:47:31,723
- [Assun] You're not on the same page.
- He was dodging, then said sorry.

1098
00:47:31,807 --> 00:47:35,060
- I'm thinking, "We're done."
- [Megumi]<i> Man, they're all so feisty.</i>

1099
00:47:44,736 --> 00:47:48,115
- What? Hikaru's the one who should go.
- I know. Think about it.

1100
00:47:48,198 --> 00:47:50,826
Hikaru was adding plenty of fuel
to the fire.

1101
00:47:50,909 --> 00:47:52,369
[door opens]

1102
00:47:53,495 --> 00:47:56,248
- [Ruru] You asleep? [laughs]
- [Assun] Wake up.

1103
00:47:56,331 --> 00:47:58,375
- [Ruru] Rise and shine.
- [Assun] You're half asleep.

1104
00:47:58,458 --> 00:47:59,459
Stay awake.

1105
00:48:01,378 --> 00:48:04,715
I came here because I was pissed off
after I heard what you said.

1106
00:48:04,798 --> 00:48:05,799
[Tai-chan] Mmm.

1107
00:48:06,383 --> 00:48:09,469
There is so much
I want to say to you, Tai-chan.

1108
00:48:09,553 --> 00:48:12,055
Here's the thing
we've all been looking for…

1109
00:48:12,139 --> 00:48:15,225
A real man in our relationships.
You know, not a boy.

1110
00:48:15,309 --> 00:48:17,519
We all came to this school
looking for that.

1111
00:48:17,603 --> 00:48:19,980
- [Tai-chan] Mmm.
- So if this is the kind of guy you are,

1112
00:48:20,063 --> 00:48:21,857
- none of us need you, okay?
- Mmm.

1113
00:48:21,940 --> 00:48:25,235
[Ruru] It's like you're not taking
Maririn's trauma seriously.

1114
00:48:26,111 --> 00:48:29,156
That's not right.
I honestly think you're a piece of trash.

1115
00:48:29,239 --> 00:48:30,324
[Ruru] Mmm-hmm.

1116
00:48:32,200 --> 00:48:34,536
[Assun] If you don't change,
if you can't act like a man,

1117
00:48:34,620 --> 00:48:36,747
then no one
is going to love you, Tai-chan.

1118
00:48:38,123 --> 00:48:40,917
- Wow. [laughing]
- Did she need to go that far? [laughs]

1119
00:48:41,001 --> 00:48:43,795
- Can you call someone trash on TV?
- Incredible.

1120
00:48:43,879 --> 00:48:46,632
He looked like he got his finger
caught in a honey trap, didn't he?

1121
00:48:46,715 --> 00:48:48,592
- [laughing]
- [Nagano] Poor Tai-chan.

1122
00:48:48,675 --> 00:48:50,344
Who knows what'll happen to him?

1123
00:48:50,427 --> 00:48:52,638
- Now that's a cliffhanger.
- What'll happen to Tai-chan?

1124
00:48:52,721 --> 00:48:54,723
[laughs] He is pretty much
hanging off the cliff.

1125
00:48:54,806 --> 00:48:56,183
[all laughing]

1126
00:48:56,266 --> 00:48:58,268
[closing theme song playing]
